{"asset_key":"ep6/quest_story_16215032","episode":"ep6","category":"quest_story","story_id":"16215032","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1621503201:1":{"text":"너희 고양이들은 꼭 그런 못된 두목만 좋아한다니까! 걘 너희가 말하는 것처럼 착하지 않다고!","source_cn":"你们这群猫就爱崇拜那种邪恶的头头！她绝对不是你们说的那样好！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2985CA0A180D9679","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1621503202:1":{"text":"라이세움에서 문제 많은 고양이로 엄청 유명했었다니까?","source_cn":"她可是当年莱希拉姆出了名的问题奶猫！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6A8CC49487A42C4A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1621503203:1":{"text":"찻잔 떨어뜨리기, 책 물어뜯기, 다른 동물들 함정으로 유인하기... 걔가 친 장난이 나무 세 그루는 돼!","source_cn":"推茶杯、咬书角、把别的动物引进陷阱……她的恶作剧能写满...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA08C90A830690A83","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1621503204:1":{"text":"그, 그리고 내 <style=\"highlight\">......</style>에게도 엄청 못된 짓을 했다고!","source_cn":"她、她还曾经对我<style=highlight>……...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x51CE60B33C1B44F5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:愤怒的狗狗":{"text":"분노한 강아지","source":"愤怒的狗狗","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":5,"localized_text_count":4,"speaker_count":1}}